  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that RNA-only multiprofile models with scvi_n200 encoder and avgpool aggregation (config_005) achieve the highest accuracy so far (0.650). This experiment tests whether replacing avgpool with transformer aggregation (while keeping RNA encoder and profile setting constant) could further improve performance. It isolates the effect of aggregation method, a key design choice, and builds on the strong evidence from config_005. This balances exploitation of the promising RNA encoder and exploration of aggregation techniques."
